{"id":"n69370-1-8","stage":5,"title":"우유부단 · 优柔寡断","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69370-1-8-1","ko":"이것으로 할지 저것으로 할지 아직도 결정을 못 하겠어.","zh":"我还是决定不了，是要选这个还是那个呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것으로","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것으로","audio":"/audio/04d003c286eb2366cdb7.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"저것으로","meaning":"那个","explanation":"저것：那个；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"저것","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31952","senseId":"1","lemma":"저것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저것으로","audio":"/audio/b8cd81abae892814f346.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"결정을","meaning":"决定","explanation":"결정：决定；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결정","audio":"/audio/3725567246990eb8a507.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83174","senseId":"1","lemma":"결정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결정을","audio":"/audio/8ff0256d093678d11c7a.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠어.","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠어","audio":"/audio/7230e426b712f7966aab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。；决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"47694f4ba3984886","term":"저것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3","entryId":"31952","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저걷"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"3725567246990eb8","term":"결정","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/3725567246990eb8a507.mp3","entryId":"83174","definition":"明确地确定怎么做某事；或指经此确定的内容。","pronunciation":["결쩡"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/421f59cee5b364a4163a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69370-1-8-2","ko":"아이고, 네 우유부단이 정말 지긋지긋하다.","zh":"